<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">Arum</book>
  <para style="h">2 Atimoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Atimoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Atimoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 A teh</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO BULUS ATA AFRI A NA NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">ATIMOTI</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Amgbasho Ablusu ata na afri ŋoh a na ni Atimoti.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya Ablusu ata Yeso nza a seh meh la meh ti bu kyangwri sa tsifa nana a ŋoh reh bleh. Nnoh a seh meh za la meh ti bleh kyangwri mboh ma ikpi fene ata a zizi ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya la ŋoh wa a nati nga reh nimeh isa Yeso Kristi reh.<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />A ba na anzoh Timoti, ata mya nza ni kira tswanza amehreh amya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Mya meh kwere Nnoh Ada ambohroh Yeso la ta ka a nza kwini anzoh, ta a lisa nnoh alindeh na tutu, tasa za la ta nga noh tuma alindeh.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nga Wuwana Ma Timoti Ma Ikpi Lisa Alindeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Mya meh te ahwra Nnoh ma aki alindeh tswanza Ada amya amboh na kiri, na agohsoh amya anyimbehreh, meh kǝ kohnoh nnoh nimeh kwere Nnoh amya na tutu a wa shini tasa za meh kǝ kwende Nnoh ma ikpi anzoh. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Mya meh kohnoh mwueneh amohnoh mya ti kǝ bleh noh la mya meh na amya reh a te meh la meh ti nza noh la meh ti nza nana gaga. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Mya meh kohnoh na nga agohsoh anzoh na Kristi, la tana anyi na amya a na na anzoh Loyis tasa ata nza a mara nnoh Yunis, ma ta ka a jiji nga agohsoh amoh na Kristi feh nnoh za seh nga agohsoh anzoh reh, nehnehreh meh wina la nnoh za ni gya agohsoh anzoh na Kristi reh. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Nza a bu dehreh, meh kira ti kohnoh na nga ata huru Nnoh nza nga noh nza meh ti kǝ gya nnoh ivoh te atoh reh, te ndohmoh ahwra Nnoh alindeh na nga wohroh. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Shi wuwana dehreh, Nnoh kǝ nga reh huru a ŋoh, huru Nnoh reh a ka a sohroh ata agohsoh ambohroh ta a nyiri kpeh, neh a ka nga reh wuwana ata kira Nnoh tasa kyangwri mboh, tasa ata wina de ikpi ambohroh alindeh. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Nza a bu dehreh ta a kama a te nnoh na isa kpeh ma aki bleh tsifa ma ikpi Ada ambohroh reh, tasa za ta a kama a te nnoh na isa ma ikpi amya kpeh la ma a de meh a ka la mya meh hwra tsifa a ŋoh bleh, neh kama nyiri iya kpeh tswanza mya ma aki hwra tsifa Kristi bleh, ta Nnoh ta nga noh wuwa agohsoh. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />A bu Nnoh a sa reh a hwana la mbohroh meh bu ahwra a ŋoh la meh ti tuma na agohsoh alindeh, a sohroh a sa reh a hwana la mbohroh meh lisa andromboh alindeh kpeh, a zaka a lisa reh alindeh a ŋoh ma. A zaka a lisa reh tsifa ata Yeso ta ka a lisa reh anyi ma jiji reh. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />nehnehreh Yeso Kristi ka a ba ba a sa reh a hwana, tasa mbohroh meh nza alindeh Nnoh nza a tsana reh, Yeso Kristi, kǝ druhu wuwana kwo ma ikpi ambohroh, mbohroh meh sehreh tsifa nana ata ŋoh nza a de a ba reh, nehnehreh mbohroh meh wina ma ikpi fene ata tuma atono na Nnoh. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />A bu tsifa nana wohroh reh ŋa Nnoh nza a seh meh la meh ti bleh ma kyangwri mboh, a tohmoh meh la meh ti bu kyangwri sa tsifa nana Yeso reh bleh, la meh ti tsana ma kyangwri mboh tsifa nana a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />A bu tsifa wohroh reh ŋa nza ma a de meh a fi ma Ida ka reh, neh a sohroh a te meh na isa leh ma Ida ka reh kpeh. Mya meh nga agohsoh amya na Yeso tasa za meh wina ŋoh alindeh Nnoh kǝ nga meh wuwana bleh tsifa a ŋoh ma kyangwri mboh na ameh ata trina ŋoh. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Nza nyi na amya tsifa a zizi ata nza ni sehreh nyi na amya reh, la nnoh za ti tsana andromboh ata nza a bu zizi. Tasa ti kǝ kira na kyangwri a ŋoh mboh. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Nnoh kǝ nga reh huru a ŋoh, lisa de huru ata huru zanana reh ta tsana noh lomo bleh tsifa reh.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Nnoh ni wina la kyangwri mboh mgba keh ma akpo nza ni Asiya ma a gyuru meh nyina, ka a wa Fajelu tasa Hamohjani.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Nnoh neh ta tsana alindeh a ŋoh ma mara Onesiforus mboh, ŋoh reh a ka a bleh meh tsifa nga wuwa itoh, tasa za a ka a sohroh a te ŋoh na isa la mya iza a ŋoh meh leh ma ida ka kpeh. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Nza ta ka a ba Roma na mareh, ka a hehndeh a fa meh a treh atsifi feh sa a ba ba a hunji meh. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Meh kwere Nnoh la ta a lisa ma Onesiforus reh alindeh ma ibi ata ŋoh nza a nati a ba ba ahwra akpi! Nnoh ni wina iya ata nza a wa ma ikpi amya la ŋoh ta a shingi meh ma Afisa.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Nza a bu dehreh Timoti, nnoh ni tswanza amehreh amya, Nnoh ta a nga noh wuwana gya agohsoh na a ŋoh a nati a shingi nnoh, la noh ni bu Yeso Kristi a ŋoh. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Tsifa ata nza ni sere nyi na amya reh, kyangwri mboh gaga ma a sehreh tasa za ma a kira la a bu zizi, nehnehreh na ni tsana ma kyangwri mboh la mata a na na a bleh ma mgbiri kyangwri amboh tswa za. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />De agohsoh wuwa twanza amboh de shira ata Yeso, ma ikpi nza iya ata mbohroh amboh tufa Kristi nza meh nati nza. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Kyangwri de ita ata nza a na gofo a ka a sohroh a fi ikpi a ŋoh ma tsifa kyangwri amboh wusu ŋoh kpeh, a ka a kira la agba a ŋoh ta a nza nana a ŋoh. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />A bu dehreh za, nza kyangwri a nati a gbo rifa, a ka a tufa akeki lomo ŋoh yehlehleh feh masa a nga ŋoh fanga alindeh. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Kyangwri hafa ata nza a hafa wuwana alindeh, ta a jiji a hunji awumu rya. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Kohnoh alindeh ma ikpi andromboh ata nza meh bleh noh reh, Ada a nati a shingi nnoh ti wina awumu mboh reh nambri.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Yeso Kristi ata nza anyi ma alohsoh Agohmoh Dawuda, Nnoh tana a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo ka a gyuru a bu na fene yama, a bu tsifa a zizi ata areh ŋa mya nza ni bleh ma kyangwri mboh reh. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />A bu tsifa bleh tsifa nana wohroh ma kyangwri mboh ŋa nza ma a de meh a tsitsiya tswanza ayuhu a fi ma Ida ka reh. Neh ma a sohroh a wina lafa tsifa Nnoh kpeh! <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />A bu dehreh za mya nza ni soh ivoh yira te iya, meh lisa dehreh ma amboh ata Nnoh nza a seh mboh la mata a bu a ŋoh reh, meh kira mboh za mata a hunji fene ma ikpi andromboh ata Yeso nza a lisa mboh reh, la mata a tuma na Nnoh a te atono ma atsi alindeh ata Nnoh nza a tuma.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Meh wina nambri ma ambohroh la a bu tsifa a zizi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">Nza meh kwo na Yeso ma inziyo areh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">Mbohroh meh nati nvara na a ŋoh za:<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />nza meh shi wuwa agohsoh na iya ma inziyo areh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">Meh nati te Agohmoh na a ŋoh ma Inza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Neh nza meh tana Kristi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">Ŋoh za a nati a bleh la ŋoh a sohroh a wina reh kpeh;<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Nza mbohroh meh za gya agohsoh na a ŋoh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">Ŋoh a nati a sohroh a sehnehna kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">Ŋoh a nati a sohroh a wina tana ikpi a ŋoh kpeh.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri Ndohmoh Alindeh Ma Nnoh</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Ti kǝ bleh ma kyangwri Nnoh mboh awumu amboh areh la ma ta ka kohnoh. Bleh mboh la mata kama a leh a were gohroh ma ikpi bleh tsifa kpeh; a ka a sohroh a shingi nnoh kpeh, ka a zaka a de amboh sere ŋoh a chakafa ma. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Te ndohmoh Nnoh ma aki ata nza a nati a nza nana, neh ka a nati a sa noh tswanza kyangwri te ndohmoh alindeh ata ŋoh nza a gya agohsoh, tsana tsifa Nnoh yehlehleh kanga, neh ndohmoh anzoh a nati a sohroh a te nnoh na isa kpeh. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Kama dohsoh noh ikpi na amboh ata nza ma a ka atsifa ma ikpi awumu ata nza a sohroh a bu ma aki Nnoh kpeh, tsifa ika ata wohroh a ka a de kyangwri mboh a te abibi ma aki Nnoh. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Tsana amoh reh a ka a de kyangwri mboh a te abibi tswanza bla ata ka a bleh kpeh. Himeniyu mboh ma Filetu ma a bu amboh tsana lomo ika wohroh. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Ma a za a tsana tsifa Nnoh ata a zizi kpeh. Ma a bleh la Nnoh a nati a za a yiri amboh ata nza ma a kwo kpeh, la Nnoh kǝ jiji nga mboh fene, nimeh wohroh maka a de agohsoh kyangwri amboh tswa a kputu, maka a za a nga agohsoh amoh na Kristi kpeh. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />amboh ata nza ma a nga agohsoh amoh ata a zizi ma Nnoh reh neh, ma tswanza chuhu Ida reh, ma a bleh a gya la: &lt;&lt;Nnoh a wina amboh ata nza ma a bu a ŋoh,&gt;&gt;tasa za la &lt;&lt; amboh ata nza ma a bleh la mboh ma a bu Nnoh a ŋoh, ma a nati ata ndohmoh agugu reh kanga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Nimeh afiya agba kyangwri awumu ndohmoh maka a yama atsetse, amboh ata nza maka a te ndohmoh agbugba reh ma a lisa na kpakpa hungroh, amboh ata nza ma a ka a te ndohmoh akǝkehreh na wohroh reh ma a lisa na agbeh tasa lu. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Akyo ata nza a de ikpi a ŋoh sehsehseh anyi na awumu abibi reh, a nati bu tswanza awumu ndohmoh alindeh reh ata Ada reh, ata nza ma a lisa a gya mata a te ndohmoh alindeh. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Lisa nza feh ti kama lisa awumu abibi ata mara kafa mboh nza ma a ka a lisa reh kpeh, ti kira lisa andromboh ata nza a bu yehlehleh, rya tohmoh na nga agohsoh anzoh na Nnoh, kira na kyangwri mboh ti kǝ tuma alindeh na amoh tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu na zana agohsoh tasa maka a kwere Nnoh. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Kama dohsoh ikpi na amboh ata nza maka a tuma a bleh tsifa duduna ata keh na aniye kpeh, nnoh ni wina la keh na aniye ka a de were gohroh a ba. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />A sohroh a zohhoh ahwra Ada ta a were gohroh kpeh; a zohhoh ta ka lisa alindeh ma kyangwri mboh nambri ma, ta ka bu kyangwri wina tsana lomo, tasa ta a bu na soh ivoh yira na kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Nza kyangwri mboh ma atsifa abibi ma ikpi a zizi tsifa Nnoh, tsana mboh ve, shingi mboh mata a wina andromboh ata nza a bu yehlehleh, ha Nnoh a nati a nga mboh lomo mata ata aki kpakpana mata a nga agohsoh na tsifa a zizi ata Nnoh reh. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Agohsoh amoh ka a nati a kohnoh yehlehleh, a bu agugu a de mboh a kohnoh awumu abibi, a de mboh a lisa andromboh ata ŋoh nza a kira, nehnehreh ma a nati a wina mata anvara anyi ma wuwana agugu reh.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ibi amboh Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Timoti meh bleh noh: Nimeh ibi amboh trina ŋoh, amboh agugu ma a nati a de amboh tufa yehlehleh a te iya. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Kyangwri ma a nati a bu amboh kira ikpi amoh, ma a nati a kira hungroh veve kpeh, ma a nati a ka a gu ikpi amoh a ka, ma ta ka a rya itoh, ma a nati a ka a kya kyangwri mboh, ma a nati a sehreh tsifa amboh ata nza ma a mara mboh kpeh, ma a nati a bu amboh kwende kpeh, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />ma a nati a lisa alindeh ma kyangwri mboh kpeh, ma a nati a bu amboh soh ivoh yira kpeh, ma a nati a wina sumu ikpi amoh kpeh, ma a nati a ka a kputu isa kyangwri mboh, ma a nati a nza kwini kyangwri mboh kpeh, ma a nati a ka a leke andromboh ata nza a bu alindeh, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />kyangwri ma a nati a te agugu ma iziza amoh mboh, ma a nati a bu na kpi kpeh, ma a nati a ka rya itoh, ma a nati a kira nza nana a keh kira na Nnoh, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />ma a nati a ka a landa la mboh ma a bu amboh tufa Nnoh dehreh neh ma a nati a ka a rina wuwana Nnoh. Kama dohsoh ikpi na kyangwri amboh ika wohroh kpeh. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Nimeh kyangwri amboh ika wohroh maka aniye a na nimeh nashi kyangwri mboh ma ta ka a hunji fya amboh ata nza ma a bu na lomo kpeh ma ta ka a landa fya amboh ata kpakpana amoh kǝ bu gaga tasa za maka a kira lisa awumu abibi tasa za maka a wina shwa ikpi amoh kpeh, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />fya amboh ika wohroh maka akpehkpehteh na tutu dehreh neh maka a sohroh a nza lomo tsifa Nnoh a wina kpeh. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Kyangwri amboh wohroh maka a tsana huru tsifa tswanza Yannes mboh ma Yambres ma ta ka a leke a zizi tsifa ma tohmoh Musa na kiri reh, agohsoh amoh kǝ chakafana tasa aki ata mboh nza ma tufa Nnoh a te abibi. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Neh ma a nati a sohroh a na gbugba kpeh la, kyangwri ma a nati a nza duduna amoh a wina, tswanza ta ka a bu na ameh ata Yannes mboh ma Yambres reh.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu Akpi Ashotoh Ma Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Nnoh, Timoti neh ni wina tsana ata mya nza ni tsana reh yehlehleh, tasa za ni wina hende amya tasa agohsoh amya, ni wina nga agohsoh amya na Nnoh, na wina soh ivoh yira amya, na kira amya na Nnoh tasa mgbiri kyangwri mboh, ni wina la meh shi wuwana na ameh ata iya, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />Ni wina iya ata nza meh wa ma akpokpo afiyafiya Antakiya, Ikoniya tasa Listira, biroh iya ata mya nza ni de ikpi ahroh. Na wohroh dehreh Nnoh a sa meh anvara nimeh amoh nambri. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />A bu mya tsimya kpeh, Kyangwri tufa Yeso ata nza a kira ta a tufa Nnoh yehlehleh a nati a hunji iya anyi na kyangwri mboh, <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Kyangwri amboh ika ata wohroh ma a nati a lisa a te abibi a keh, amboh anyi nimeh amoh ma a nati a tsana tsifa huru tsifa tasa ma ta ka a tufa huru tsifa. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Nnoh neh, ni nati gya agohsoh anzoh na tsifa ata nza ma a tsana noh reh, ni wina la tsifa amboh wohroh ma a bu zizi, ni wina amboh ata nza ma a tsana noh tsifa amboh wohroh, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />tasa nyi na amehreh akehreh nnoh ni wina lomo nyi ma amgbasho Nnoh reh, amgbasho reh a tsana noh aki lomo la Nnoh a sa noh anvara la nnoh ni gya agohsoh anzoh na Kristi Yeso. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Tsifa mboh nza ma a ŋa nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh anyi na huru Nnoh ta saza a ka shingi reh ma akeki gaga, a ka akpi reh ashotoh nza meh lisa andromboh abibi, a ka tsana reh andromboh ata nza a bu yehlehleh ta ka a tsana reh aki tuma alindeh, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />la amboh ata nza ma a kira mata a tufa Nnoh reh ma a nati a tuma alindeh ma a nati a bu kyangwri ata nza ma a nati a wina lisa andromboh alilehndeh.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Timoti, mya meh bleh noh areh shimba la Nnoh tasa Kristi Yeso a wina awumu mboh nza Mbohroh meh lisa nambri, nza Kristi tana a ba aki de Agohmoh ma inziyo, a nati ahwra akpi ma amboh ata nza ma a kwo tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu na fene, tasa nza tana a ba tasa kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh, a nati a lisa ata nza a tswa ŋoh, meh bleh areh nehnehreh. <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Bleh tsifa Nnoh ma kyangwri mboh; tuma ni la kira bleh tsifa Nnoh yehlehleh na tutu; kpi mboh ashotoh nza ma a lisa andromboh abibi, tasa te bleh andromboh ata nza a zohhoh mata a lisa, tasa ti kǝ bu kyangwri soh ivoh yira nza ni tsana mboh aki alindeh. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Ameh a nati a ba kyangwri mboh ma a nati a sohroh a kira tsifa a zizi ata Nnoh reh kpeh. neh ma a nati a kira tsifa ata a nati a nana mboh ma agohsoh feh, ma a nati a dohsoh amboh tsana huru tsifa gaga la mata a ba ba a bleh mboh tsifa ata nza a nati a nana mboh ma ashotoh. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Ma a nati a hama ashotoh amoh la mata a kama a sehreh tsifa Nnoh ata a zizi kpeh, neh ma a nati a kira mata sere kakranda amboh ata nza a bu zizi kpeh. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Nnoh Timoti neh, de agohsoh anzoh ti kohnoh yehlehleh ma akeki mboh nambri, de agohsoh wuwa nimeh iya, te ndohmoh kyangwri bleh tsifa nana ata Kristi ma kyangwri mboh, te ndohmoh ata Nnoh nza nga noh la ti lisa la noh ni bu ahwra a ŋoh. <verse eid="2TI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Mya meh ba whiri meh ti kwo, kwo amya a nati a bu tswanza ma a de ngǝnga ata amwo wa a ba ti a nga Nnoh, tasa za ameh kǝ ba fene amya ahwra Nnoh ta a trina. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Mya meh te ndohmoh ahwra Kristi alindeh, mya meh te ndohmoh Nnoh reh tre, meh tswanza kyangwri gbo rifa ata kǝ gbo tre, mya meh nga agohsoh na tsifa a zizi ata Nnoh. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Nehnehreh nga ata firoh ndohmoh amya a buti bana meh, Ada a nati a nga meh fanga ata nza nana, a nati a bu tswanza gbama ata Nnoh nza a nati a nga meh ma ibi agba ata hwra akpi wohroh, ŋoh a bu kyangwri hwra akpi ata a zizi ŋoh. A nati a sohroh a nga meh mya tsimya kpeh a nati a nga amboh ata nza ma a kira na a ŋoh nambri za, ma a nati a nza nana mata a nza ŋoh nza a nati a gyuru a ba.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsifa Ablusu Nza A bleh Ma Timoti Ata Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Timoti nza ni hunji aki te gbo ba bu were na amya, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Demas kǝ gbo yi meh ta kǝ na ŋoh akpo afya Tassalonika, a kira la ŋoh ta a nza nana awumu inziyo areh gaga mi. Kirzens kǝ na a ŋoh Galatiyawa, Titus za kǝ na a ŋoh Dalmaniya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Ka a treh a hwa Luka ma na amya na mareh. Wa Markus reh de ba, a nati a shingi meh nimeh ndohmoh Nnoh reh. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Mya meh tohmoh Tikikus na akpo afya ata Afisa. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Nza ni nati ba, sa kuri awo amya na Karbus nza a bu ma Toruwas de ba meh, tasa za de amgbasho amya mboh reh ba meh, nza ni nati wina de ba meh nambri kpeh, seh amboh alilehndeh ŋoh mboh reh de ba meh. <verse eid="2TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alekzanda nza a ka a lisa awumu anyi ma karafi reh, a de meh a te iya veve kpeh. Nnoh a nati a de ŋoh a te iya ma ikpi ndohmoh abibi wohroh reh. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Nnoh za lisa nza feh kavoh kpeh reh neh a nati a de noh a te iya za. A ka a keh na aniye a leke na tsifa ambohroh.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Meh ti kǝ shi ma atsi hwra akpi bleh ma Agohmoh shwa ikpi amya la mya meh sohroh lisa andromboh kpeh ma jiji ŋoh reh, akyo a sohroh a shingi meh kpeh a wa ziza amya mboh. Mya meh kwere Nnoh ta a gu kpakpana amoh a te kohhroh. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Nnoh neh tana a bu na amya ka shingi meh, ka a nga meh wuwana la mya ti bleh tsifa a ŋoh yehlehleh ma amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh nza ma anyi akpokpo atsifi maka sere tsifa ata mya nza ni bleh reh. Ma aki wohroh Nnoh ka a sa meh a hwana anyi ma kwo nyi na amboh agugu mboh. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Nnoh a nati a ka a sa meh a hwana anyi ma agugu mboh dehreh ta a gu meh alindeh a na inza ma atsi de Agohmoh a ŋoh. Riri ta a bu a ŋoh a treh ameh! Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsifa Na Amoh Ata Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Tsifa meh noh na Biriskila tasa Akila, tasa amboh nashi Onesiforus. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Arastusu a treh a yama ma akpo afya Korinti, tasa meh ta Turofimus ma akpo afya Miletus a sohroh a wuwana kpeh. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Kavohshama ba fifi feh ameh awo sa a ba. Yubulus tasa Fudens, tasa Lainus, tasa Kalaudiya, tasa mgbiri amboh tufa mboh ma tsifa na amohnoh.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Meh kwere Nnoh ta a bu na huru amohnoh ta a nga noh wuwana. Lisa alindeh ta a bu na amohnoh nambri.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>